# Git approval (hard)

- Do NOT run `git commit`, `git amend`, or `git push` unless the user explicitly asks in the current message.
- Do NOT commit on the remote GPU box. Source of truth is this Mac repo; remote receives approved sync only.
- Never commit: `.env`, `HF_TOKEN`, model weights, `catalog/installed.json`, secrets.
- Remote changes via `ai sync` / rsync only after local commits the user approved.
